{room, key=debugging_room, name=Debugging Room
    {enter_message
        output={@
This room is full of BUGS!!
You can use this room to intentionally define something wrong, or do typos in
your definitions, to see how to identify and fix them.
This room is also helpful for developers who may want to improve
WorldWeaver - so that typos etc are handled better.

**Referenced Element Typo Test:**
To set up this test, add an extra 't' to [tplt_syntax]((x_tables))
Then upon entering this room type: x tables
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@
You look around...

This room is full of BUGS!!
You can use this room to intentionally define something wrong, or do typos in
your definitions, to see how to identify and fix them.
This room is also helpful for developers who may want to improve
WorldWeaver - so that typos etc are handled better.

**Referenced Element Typo Test:**
To set up this test, add an extra 't' to [tplt_syntax]((x_tables))
Then upon entering this room type: x tables
            }
        }
    }

    {x_tables
        {message
            output={@
You examine the tables.
Some of them have crystal glasses sitting on them, still full of alcohol.
            }
        }
    }


    {inject, logic=/nav_home.inj }
    {inject, logic=/home.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_tables))
        {act, logic=x_tables, tags=!_type|room }
    }
}

